---
description: Prepare one verifyReadiness evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: TransitionOption[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Recheck actual delivery, provider acceptance, access, and participant acknowledgments before the transition. Distinguish scheduled from completed prerequisites and record the authorized release decision separately from the program’s readiness summary. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
